    narr:narration """This narrative holds a single position on [siting the repair stand where riders actually break down and securing the pump against theft](narr:Position_RepairStandSitingAndPumpSecurity). Its frame asks where the problems the provision exists to solve occur, and what must hold for the equipment to still be there when needed — answered by placing the stand at the river path entrance rather than the car park, and chaining the pump after the last one walked off.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_RepairStandSitingAndPumpSecurity> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The public repair stand goes by the river path entrance, not in the car park. The river path is where the flats happen." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_RepairStandSitingAndPumpSecurity> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Put the pump on a chain; the last one walked off in a week." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_RepairStandSitingAndPumpSecurity> ] ;
